{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159850/extras/1ff0bcb313c28da162ea05418456c68d.avif?t=1746524161\" width=615 height=150 /></span><br>Today was supposed to be just another day in the life of a farmer. Another day pining for the girl he loves. Today was not about watching bandits wreck everything and kidnap his crush. <br><br>Now taking on the role of Castor armed with an oversized carrot and a sip of courage, you must traverse treacherous terrain and powerful foes to save your crush in this 2D action platformer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159850/extras/83e6fb4659fc906ebd63d1e4c9a60208.avif?t=1746524161\" width=615 height=150 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Travel across varied locales from mushroom forests to abandoned castles, all while contending with all manner of danger lurking about!<br></li><li> Strike down powerful foes with your giant carrot sword! Or throw it at them instead!<br></li><li> Fight dangerous bosses with devastating attacks!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159850/extras/d51c38f55132bcc96dd747e1d01d6fac.avif?t=1746524161\" width=615 height=150 /></span><br>Greetings, fellow knights!<br><br>Creating ExCarrotBur!! has been a big step forward for us. As you can imagine, building something very different from our prior projects takes a lot more effort and time to make but we hope the results will be well worth it!<br><br>From all of us here at Roundtable Games, we hope that you\u2019ll have a great time following Castor on his grand adventure and we look forward to bringing you along on wherever our journey takes us next!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159850?t=1746524161","backgrou